        <activityName xml:lang="en">xxx Electricity, production mix IT</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Electricity, production mix IT
Electricity domestic net production shares are based on IEA statistics for the year 2008.;
UUID: b84a16c7-dc6f-38e2-85de-f7d243376518
It includes the shares of domestic electricity production by technology at the busbar. It does not include transformation, transport nor distribution losses.
Location: Data apply to public and self producers in Italy.
Technology: No technology description is provided because the dataset just describes the power plant portfolio of the respective country using current (2004) average technology per energy carrier.
Time period: Time period of statistics used (2008).
Production volume: 319 TWh
Sampling: Statistical data 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_b84a16c7-dc6f-38e2-85de-f7d243376518.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
